# Audio Engine

Playback is driven entirely by `KitModel`. Never read SFZ (or any external format) during playback.

## Real-time safety

- Never block the audio thread.
- Never perform disk IO inside `processBlock()`.
- Decode/load samples ahead of time (preload), not on the audio thread.

## Must keep working

Sample playback must always honor: velocity layers, round robins, articulations, choke groups, and future multi-output routing.
